{"title":"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> has the following three properties:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b700dc7026b2d9ce2e66b97ccfa5e97a3651f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2e1e17ceeebd558ef45606d7fa1e93d1e92c8d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2n) = (f(n))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"21\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/a/86a4b1ba7c81902405928923371596ff3564f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2m + 1) = 3f(2m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" /></li>\n\nDetermine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/24134b20428068473c2abc993e5b899a856568a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + f(3) + f(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the second property, we can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c766f9fce6070981e62f805a7cf7294baed4498e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. We get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/5/2f5b66453fef074b8224fef7fa59e6854a120572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2 \\times 1) = (f(1))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b700dc7026b2d9ce2e66b97ccfa5e97a3651f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> using the first property, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036d0a6a0ec2a91db3171e7fdf565dd84ff2fec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2 \\times 1) = 3^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08fd62d22dff56f6b24e1e359e087d927f40adcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Next, using the third property, we can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73baad1d05e4bc4d4067fd6dfcc164e339bf981a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a70a8ac53cb1d20297e44668457eeac9c22527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2 \\times 1 + 1) = 3f(2 \\times 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"197\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245eecde21299c8feb8845df2d885b52402e2b60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 3f(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08fd62d22dff56f6b24e1e359e087d927f40adcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> from the value we just got, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a79c528a83f8ce1e2a71583fde04e9e3320164b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 3 \\times 9 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Using the second property again for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/598a16d4b7dde3dec3a390109882d54bb0308ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/9/a09f87ff4713c7aaf672cfd29f2996d510c062ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2 \\times 2) = (f(2))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08fd62d22dff56f6b24e1e359e087d927f40adcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea0fa51aae895394a3fdc188157aa04b10a9183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2 \\times 2) = 9^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/e/b2ecec593f3f458f897a86d2275224cc86895abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4) = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd205deba82239954c341234a228762baa35213d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + f(3) + f(4) = 9 + 27 + 81 = \\boxed{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"325\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c9130745ee0a2902b94d354a252d3787d7edbc4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = 3^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/5/6757642e9affc111b53328bf0eff3a09c55d03cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2n) = 3^{2n} = (3^{n})^{2} = (f(n))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"242\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437df5c3b6742baf58df384c656c56811e58a8f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 3^{1} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4914d4d52cdd19996e85f490098f0c9b548542.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2m + 1) = 3^{2m + 1} = 3^{2m} \\times 3^{1} = 3f(2m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"327\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c020f8a95769d64bb321d57019560d04dfff487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 3^{2} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f224f69d3f9b873a0c0f647c2a1d43c9414de35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 3^{3} = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/e/b2ecec593f3f458f897a86d2275224cc86895abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4) = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of these is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/0/52056b7a8fca7b3706037abb185d0e4c1f5d8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 + 27 + 81 = \\boxed{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"155\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 142/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5433/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.312      1 2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    6.312      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35996:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025643 and revision id 279595. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}